# Local secrets for `npm run dev` / `npm run preview` (wrangler reads .dev.vars).
# Copy to .dev.vars. In production each is a secret:
#   npx wrangler secret put <NAME>

# Signs session cookies. Required in production; any long random string.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# The site's origin, e.g. https://seqbaby.com. Optional: without it each
# hostname the Worker answers on (previews, localhost) uses its own.
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=https://seqbaby.com

# Who auth email comes from. The domain must be onboarded to Cloudflare Email
# Service (npx wrangler email sending enable <domain>).
# EMAIL_FROM=seqbaby <no-reply@seqbaby.com>

# Compose chat on this site's key. Optional: without it, visitors can still
# compose on a key of their own.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxx
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5

# Superbugs page (app/superbugs, app/api/bugs) — OPTIONAL. A fine-grained GitHub
# token with Issues: write on the repo. Without it the form falls back to a
# prefilled github.com new-issue link. With TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY set, /api/bugs
# refuses a report without a valid Turnstile token.
# GITHUB_ISSUES_TOKEN=github_pat_xxx
# GITHUB_ISSUES_REPO=mjoslyn/seqbaby
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=0x4AAAAAAA...

# Only while moving data over from Supabase (scripts/migrate-from-supabase.mjs).
# MIGRATION_TOKEN=
